# icp's routes (core/modules/icp/README.md "Routes"): the workspace's one ICP and its six criteria.
# A write sends the cookie, so it sends Origin: {{appOrigin}} too (the api's origin check).

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp: the ICP; the first read creates it empty, with its six criteria
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### PUT /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp: saves the ICP; a targeting change moves its version
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{
  "name": "EMEA mid-market",
  "titles": ["Head of Sales", "VP Sales"],
  "seniorities": ["vp", "head"],
  "industries": ["Software"],
  "sizeRanges": ["51-200", "201-500"],
  "countries": ["FR", "DE"],
  "mustHaves": "Sells to finance teams.",
  "disqualifiers": "Agencies and consultancies."
}

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp/criteria: the six criteria with their weights and flags
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp/criteria
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### PUT /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp/criteria: saves the six criteria; the weights sum to 100
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp/criteria
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{
  "criteria": [
    { "key": "title_function", "weight": 30, "isMust": true, "enabled": true },
    { "key": "seniority", "weight": 15, "isMust": false, "enabled": true },
    { "key": "company_size", "weight": 10, "isMust": false, "enabled": true },
    { "key": "industry", "weight": 15, "isMust": false, "enabled": true },
    { "key": "location", "weight": 10, "isMust": true, "enabled": true },
    { "key": "must_haves", "weight": 20, "isMust": false, "enabled": true }
  ]
}
